deo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive into the depths to collect valuable resources and equipment, then resurface to face waves of ever more fearsome enemies.</strong>\u00a0And above all, upgrade and repair your pirate ship to explore even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/bbc6adc1910bd9204f5b4d653996cbfd.avif?t=1761139949\" width=616 height=148 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/ff8822d8e9d590f7dfd41a58dcfac6be.poster.avif?t=1761139949\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/ff8822d8e9d590f7dfd41a58dcfac6be.webm?t=1761139949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/ff8822d8e9d590f7dfd41a58dcfac6be.mp4?t=1761139949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet colorful characters!</strong> But who is that old hermit on his island? Hmmm... This adventure might turn out to be far more dangerous than it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/e06226fb44ab53eb01a901c6b97faa55.avif?t=1761139949\" width=616 height=148 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/7d8c5f89b4124e63b0babc4a71d56a14.poster.avif?t=1761139949\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/7d8c5f89b4124e63b0babc4a71d56a14.webm?t=1761139949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/7d8c5f89b4124e63b0babc4a71d56a14.mp4?t=1761139949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gather precious relics... but beware of curses</strong> <strong>that could lead to your downfall. Yet death is not the end!</strong> Keep returning to the mysterious island of Iticali and set sail again to reclaim your former pirate glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/c2ee4488ac0bddbc4281890668584792.avif?t=1761139949\" width=616 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>An accessible roguelite at the heart of a thrilling pirate universe.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the ocean depths and progress ever further.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Surface battles blending reflexes and strategy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Numerous gadgets and upgrades to vary your approach.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Dozens of unique relics and curses that will shake up every run.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-drawn illustrations and a rich, immersive soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About the voices in our game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We\u2019re a small independent studio, and our priority has always been to deliver the best possible experience with the resources we have. For this project, we decided to use AI-generated voices to bring the characters to life, rather than leaving the game silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Our goal is simple: to make the adventure more immersive and enjoyable for you right now. However, we know that nothing can truly replace the talent and emotion that professional voice actors bring to a game. Just like we\u2019ve done in the past, as soon as our budget allows, we plan to work with professional voice actors to reach an even higher level of quality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for your understanding and support. Your enthusiasm motivates us to keep pushing forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2014 The Ninp\u00f4 Game Studio Team</p>","developers":["NINPO Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/7c3cf343caba9e717e3ed961ddb007395a3e01ba/header.jpg?t=1761139949","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Pirates:Rogue's Fortune, developed by NINP\u00d4 Game Studio.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4570T / AMD A10-5800K APU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 650 (1024 Mb) Radeon HD 7750 (1024 Mb), Iris Pro Graphics 580. OpenGL 2.1 or later.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p, producing 60 FPS</li></ul